{"type":"Feature","id":768,"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[46.48458766938989,7.270874531260688]},"properties":{"land":null,"category":"all","language":"en","title":"Alpenruhe Experience World","abstract":"In Saanenland, the Alpenruhe Foundation offers a varied programme for families: the adventure world, with its large play area, petting zoo, adventure garden and café, is the ideal place to enjoy a relaxing and entertaining time in the fresh air.","description":"Children will have a fantastic time in the play area, which has a pirate ship, a jumping pillow, a children’s train and various playhouses. In the water zone, the little ones can build something or go on a treasure hunt.\n\nThe petting zoo is the perfect place to observe animals up close and even pet them. The cute dwarf goats, rabbits and other animals eagerly await visitors and provide a popular photo opportunity.\n\nAlpenruhe also has a fragrant and flowering adventure garden: you have the opportunity to enjoy herbs and flowers with all your senses there.\n\nCatering is provided too: you can relax on the covered terrace and have a drink and something to eat in peace at the café. The shop has products from the Alpenruhe Foundation and is also located in the café.","highlights":null,"foto":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/03_c_deeds_Yannick_Romagnoli-Alpenruhe-Streichelzoo-klein _2_g.jpg","foto_urls":{"275X220":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/03_c_deeds_Yannick_Romagnoli-Alpenruhe-Streichelzoo-klein _2_275x220.jpg","550X440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/03_c_deeds_Yannick_Romagnoli-Alpenruhe-Streichelzoo-klein _2_550x440.jpg","1800X1440":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/03_c_deeds_Yannick_Romagnoli-Alpenruhe-Streichelzoo-klein _2_1800x1440.jpg","900X720":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/03_c_deeds_Yannick_Romagnoli-Alpenruhe-Streichelzoo-klein _2_900x720.jpg"},"foto_abstract":null,"photo_gallery":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/01_c_deeds_Yannick_Romagnoli-